":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1540,"endLine":1552}]},{"id":"source-file-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"For a non-admin caller, the source file is retrieved by file ID together with user.id, so the check binds access to the supplied file to the caller.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1559,"endLine":1564}]},{"id":"destination-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The destination is taken from form_data.collection_name, with a file-specific default only when the caller does not supply one; the supplied collection name is therefore the destination passed onward.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1564,"endLine":1570}]},{"id":"content-flow-to-docs","kind":"condition","statement":"When collection_name is supplied, the handler obtains the file content from the file's processed collection or file data and constructs documents containing that content and file metadata.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1597,"endLine":1626}]},{"id":"delegation-with-add","kind":"control","statement":"The handler delegates to save_docs_to_vector_db using the caller-selected collection_name and sets add to True when form_data.collection_name was supplied; the visible call contains no destination ownership or write-grant authorization argument or check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1683,"endLine":1706}]},{"id":"existing-collection-path","kind":"control","statement":"In save_docs_to_vector_db, an existing collection is detected and is not returned from or rejected when add is True; the helper continues toward embedding and insertion.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1458,"endLine":1467}]},{"id":"destination-write-sink","kind":"effect","statement":"The protected effect is VECTOR_DB_CLIENT.insert into collection_name with the generated items containing the document text and metadata.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1517,"endLine":1533}]},{"id":"authorization-distinction","kind":"condition","statement":"The visible authorization-related check establishes only that a non-admin can retrieve the source file by file ID and user ID; no visible control establishes destination ownership or an explicit destination write grant before the insert sink.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-a138c442b21f885c","startLine":1559,"endLine":1564}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":1077,"output":976,"cacheRead":5504,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":48816.6212,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:34:39.593Z"}}
